Subject: [PATCH] Preserve preset load and expression diagnostics through standard handlers

Local fix against projectM 4.1.7 plus patches 0001–0026. Restore the existing
owned preset/factory error messages when public loading catches std::exception;
preset acceptance and rendering are unchanged. Includes inherited-interface and
public failure-event regression tests.

